on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 34 ............................. <34>
  [  3] get 7 ................................... <the timer>
  [  5] getglobal 54 ............................ <FindusTimer>
  [  8] gt ...................................... <the timer > FindusTimer>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 27] ............................ if the timer > FindusTimer then / else
  [ 12] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 14] thebuiltin 21 ........................... <the frame>
  [ 16] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 19] add ..................................... <the frame + 1>
  [ 20] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame + 1>
  [ 22] extcall 22 .............................. go(the frame + 1)
  [ 24] jmp [ 35]
  [ 27] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 29] thebuiltin 21 ........................... <the frame>
  [ 31] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [ 33] extcall 22 .............................. go(the frame)
  [ 35] ret
end
